    ryft-argocd-operation: P10: a sync operation must not carry local manifests or a source of its own.
P10 server sync other revision
    ryft-argocd-operation: P10: a sync started through the API server must use the target revision or the revision the Application is synced to.
P10 server sync source (rollback)
    ryft-argocd-operation: P10: a sync operation must not carry local manifests or a source of its own.
P10 server sync sources
    ryft-argocd-operation: P10: a sync operation must not carry local manifests or a source of its own.
