P11 additional plugin
    ryft-broker: P11: the broker's plugins and configuration are pinned (broker.additionalPlugins and additionalConfigLines in the chart); advancedConfig, envConfig and erlangInetConfig are refused.
P11 additionalConfig with a new line
    ryft-broker: P11: the broker's plugins and configuration are pinned (broker.additionalPlugins and additionalConfigLines in the chart); advancedConfig, envConfig and erlangInetConfig are refused.
P11 advancedConfig
    ryft-broker: P11: the broker's plugins and configuration are pinned (broker.additionalPlugins and additionalConfigLines in the chart); advancedConfig, envConfig and erlangInetConfig are refused.
P11 envConfig
